### Logs and JVM crash artifacts ###
*.log
logs/
# hs_err_pid*.log / replay_pid*.log are already covered by *.log above, but a JVM crash or an
# OutOfMemoryError can also drop heap dumps and Windows minidumps, which are hundreds of MB.
*.hprof
*.mdmp

